A. symbolic checks
  Hoeffding exponent, range 4: 2*s**2
  argmin s = u/(4*n) ; min exponent = -u**2/(8*n)
  exp(-u^2/(8n)) at u=sqrt(8 n log(1/delta)): delta
  2u/n - 4 sqrt(2 log(1/delta)/n) = 0
  Thm C.6: 4 sqrt(2 log(1/d)/n) = eps/4  at n = [-512*log(delta)/epsilon**2]
  Thm C.6: A N^g/(eta n) = eps/4 at n = [4*A*N_g/(epsilon*eta)] ; 4 rho = eps/2 at rho = [epsilon/8]
  Cor C.2.1: rho = eps/8, A N^g/(eta(n+1)) = eps/2 at n+1 = [2*A*N_g/(epsilon*eta)]
  Thm C.7: n * (lambda/n)^2 * 16/8 = 2*lambda**2/n
  Thm C.7 chain: 2 lambda/n + 2 lambda/n with lambda = eta n: 4*eta
  Thm C.7(i): 4rho+4eta at eps/16 = epsilon/2 ; threshold n = [32*K/epsilon**2] (K = A N^g + 2 log(1/delta))
  Thm C.7(ii): claim - actual = 2*l*(N_g - 1)/(sqrt(N_g)*sqrt(n))  (>= 0 iff N^g >= 1)
  Thm C.5(c): 4(4+sqrt 2) = 21.65685424949238 < 22
  Remark C.7.1: off-event contribution 4 * 2/n = 8 / n

